==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|h₂ey}}
[[syncope|Syncope]] of earlier {{m|la|aevitās}}, from {{inh|la|itc-pro|*aiwotāts}}, from {{m|itc-pro|*aiwom}} (whence also {{m|la|aevum}}) + {{m|itc-pro|*-tāts}} (whence also {{m|la|-tās}}), from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₂eyu-||vital energy}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ey-}}. Surface etymology: from {{suffix|la|aevum|tās}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|eccl=yes|aetās}}
* {{rhymes|aːs|lang=la}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|aetās|aetātis|f|third}}

# [[lifetime]], [[age]], [[era]], [[period]] of time or life
# {{lb|la|metonymic}} a [[generation]]

